# X1 -- Does the fixed roster keep every inactive species away, on every layer? A season on a copy of the alpha trial fort (Boatsbowed, the tester's own roster: 61 inactive) under v6.3.0, which holds every inactive species at stock 0 or frequency 1 and seasons every active one. Also X7: the job and tab timings over the same season.
